OL,3,GNEWSARare investigation amid
OL,4,Aallegations about council officers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rarely-convened committee is to
OL,7,Finvestigate the robustness of Derby
OL,8,FCity Council's procedures.
OL,10,FFormer chief executive Paul Simpson
OL,11,Fannounced his departure in April, and
OL,12,Fin recent weeks some media outlets have
OL,13,Fpublished allegations about the
OL,14,Fbehaviour of officers working for the
OL,15,Fauthority.
OL,17,FIn response, the council released a
OL,18,Fstatement which described the content
OL,19,Fof the media reports as "inaccurate and
OL,20,Fmisleading".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
