OL,3,GNEWSARare investigation amid
OL,4,Aallegations about council officers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Derby City Council Investigating
OL,7,Fand Disciplinary Committee, made up of
OL,8,Fsitting councillors, will scrutinise
OL,9,Fthe authority's procedures alongside a
OL,10,Fseparate review already under way over
OL,11,Fcouncil processes, overseen by the
OL,12,Finterim chief executive Sam Dennis.
